  "text": "To change a flat tire, follow these steps:\n\n1. Park the vehicle on a stable, flat surface and apply the parking brake.\n2. Remove the hubcap and loosen the lug nuts with a wrench.\n3. Use a jack to lift the car off the ground.\n4. Remove the lug nuts completely and take off the flat tire.\n5. Replace the flat tire with the spare tire.\n6. Re-secure the lug nuts but do not tighten them fully yet.\n7. Lower the car and remove the jack.\n8. Fully tighten the lug nuts.\n9. Replace the hubcap."
